== Requirements (official)
- Paragraph Structure
  + Identify an important contemporary issue that most reasonable, well-informed people think is still and open question--that is, one where there is insufficient evidence to settle the question. Explain this in enough detail to show why it is uncertain and what is at stake.
  + explain what you think that clifford's advice would dictate in this situation and why
  + critically evaluate clifford's advice explaining whether or not it seems reasonable and why
  + conclude with critical evaluatino of clifford's position, given the conclusions that you came to in section three.

